fb7-ad24a2e23c29","settings":{"product":"{{product}}","widget_type":"reviews_widget"}}},"block_order":["okendo_reviews_widget_V3CQAB"],"name":"Okendo Reviews","settings":{}},"product_faq_qKQPBF":{"type":"product-faq","blocks":{"faq_QLdXc7":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Is the Hearth Pedestal included?","answer":"<p>The Hearth Pedestal isn’t included, but it’s a highly recommended add-on, especially if you plan to use your Hearth Infrared Sauna Panel outside an enclosure or in a cabinet sauna conversion. You can easily add the Pedestal to your order right on the Hearth Buy page.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_CpQxNF":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Can I add the Hearth to my existing cabinet sauna?","answer":"<p>Yes, it’s one of the most effective ways to transform a traditional or far-infrared cabinet sauna into a full-spectrum, near infrared sanctuary.<\/p><p><strong>Recommended setup: <\/strong>Use the Hearth Pedestal and Sauna Stool to position the panel at core level. If needed, remove your built-in bench and sit on the stool for targeted, radiant light therapy.<\/p><p><strong>Bench setup: <\/strong>Place your Hearth securely on your sauna’s built-in bench. Just be sure the height and angle allow for full-body exposure.<\/p><p><strong>Wall-mount setup: <\/strong>Use the Hearth’s built-in handle to hang it on a wall. Be sure to anchor with hardware rated for at least 25 lbs.<\/p><p>Note: Results vary depending on sauna size and materials. The Hearth Quartet heats spaces up to 60–70 cubic feet. For larger cabinets, therapeutic heat will be gentler. Use our sauna volume calculator for guidance.<\/p><p>Want a deeper dive? <a href=\"https:\/\/help.sauna.space\/en-US\/how-do-i-upgrade-my-cabinet-sauna-with-my-hearth-panel-654779\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"How do I upgrade my cabinet sauna with my Hearth® panel?\">Here’s our full article on cabinet sauna upgrades.<\/a><\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_NhTmQr":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Can I use the Hearth outside a sauna enclosure?","answer":"<p>Absolutely. The Hearth shines outside a sauna, too, perfect for red light therapy while you work, stretch, meditate, or relax. It’s ideal for skin rejuvenation, blue light blocking, circadian support, and energy regulation throughout the day.<\/p><p>Use it as a warm, flicker-free light in the morning or evening to balance your sleep-wake cycle. Just note that without heat retention, you won’t get a detoxifying sweat. Sweating requires a sauna enclosure. <\/p><p>Still, for mood, energy, and cellular nourishment, the Hearth delivers in any setting.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_pb8iRj":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"How do I mount or use the Hearth?","answer":"<p>The Hearth is plug-and-glow simple.<\/p><p>The most stable setup is on the Hearth Pedestal. Just place it upright, centered, and balanced, no tools required. It stands on its own without needing to lean on anything.<\/p><p>Prefer a wall-mounted experience? Use the built-in handle to hang it with anchors or heavy-duty hardware (25+ lb rating recommended).<\/p><p>Wherever it lives, make sure the light reaches your body directly for optimal benefit.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_jnAngC":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"How much electricity does the Hearth use?","answer":"<p>Very little, especially considering how much energy it gives you in return.<\/p><ul><li> 750 watts → ~12¢ per hour<\/li><li>1000 watts → ~16¢ per hour<\/li><\/ul><p>That’s less than running your dishwasher and far more regenerative.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_iwU6eD":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"What’s the difference between the Hearth Trio and Hearth Quartet?","answer":"<p>The <strong>Trio<\/strong> has three FireLight® Bulbs and is great for small spaces, shorter sessions, or pairing with other wellness tools.<\/p><p>The <strong>Quartet<\/strong> offers more heat, higher irradiance, and faster results, perfect for primary sauna sessions or deeper intensity.<\/p><p>If you’re unsure, go with the Quartet. You can always use fewer bulbs during a session, but you can’t add a bulb to a Trio later.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_NxMACB":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Should I rotate during my session?","answer":"<p>It depends on your goal.<\/p><p>If you’re going for full-body coverage, gentle rotation helps ensure even exposure.<\/p><p>If you’re doing targeted red light therapy say, on your chest, face, or joints, just sit still and soak in the light.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_BChdgc":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"How close should I sit to the Hearth?","answer":"<p>For most sessions, sit <strong>18–30 inches away<\/strong>. Adjust based on comfort, closer for stronger intensity, farther if it feels too warm. You should feel gently warmed, not overheated.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_XUiCnx":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Is it safe to use the Hearth every day?","answer":"<p>Yes, daily use is both safe and encouraged. Most people enjoy <strong>5–15 minute sessions<\/strong> once or twice a day. Build it into your morning, wind-down, or post-workout routine.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_xyyxNE":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Does the Hearth get hot?","answer":"<p>It gets warm, not scorching. The Hearth emits radiant heat along with red and near infrared light, similar to a gentle sunbeam. If it feels too intense, increase your distance or shorten your session.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_Vc4DTE":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Can I travel with the Hearth?","answer":"<p>Yes, the Hearth is designed to be portable. While it’s larger than the Glow, it’s still easy to travel with, especially by car. The Trio weighs about 7 lbs and the Quartet around 11.5 lbs, with a built-in handle for convenient carrying. Just be sure let the panel cool completely. Many people take their Hearth to rentals, retreats, or hotel stays.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_rrrMEJ":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Can I lie down while using the Hearth?","answer":"<p>You can! Just ensure the Hearth is on a stable surface, like a chair or low table, not a bed or soft surface. Many people use it this way during yoga, breathwork, or rest.<\/p><p>It can also sit directly on a hardwood or tile floor but not on a carpeted or synthetic (like PVC or laminate).<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_3YfF9m":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"How long do FireLight® Bulbs last in the Hearth, and how do I replace them?","answer":"<p>Each FireLight® Bulb in the Hearth is rated for 5,000 hours, typically lasting 5–10 years depending on usage.<\/p><p>When it’s time, replacement is easy, just screw in a new one like a regular bulb. No tools required.<\/p><p>If a bulb burns out within 5 years, it’s covered under warranty. After that, replacements are available at a <strong>discounted rate of $95<\/strong>.<\/p><p>You’ll always be supported and glowing.<\/p>","type":"info"}}},"block_order":["faq_QLdXc7","faq_CpQxNF","faq_NhTmQr","faq_pb8iRj","faq_jnAngC","faq_iwU6eD","faq_NxMACB","faq_BChdgc","faq_XUiCnx","faq_xyyxNE","faq_Vc4DTE","faq_rrrMEJ","faq_3YfF9m"],"name":"Core Product FAQ","settings":{"section_id":"faq-hearth-infrared-sauna-panel","last_updated":"2025-07-21","color_scheme":"scheme-2","overlay_background_mobile":false,"content_width":"fullwidth","container_alignment":"left","keep_accordions_closed":true,"alt_links_view":false,"title":"The Hearth FAQ","title_alignment":"center","content":"<p><strong>Got questions about the Hearth?<\/strong> You’re not alone. From cabinet sauna upgrades to daily light therapy, this powerful panel inspires a lot of curiosity. Below, we cover the most common questions about setup, usage, and how the Hearth compares to saunas and red light panels, so you can get the most from your infrared ritual.<\/p>","content_alignment":"left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_alignment":"center","about_entities":"infrared sauna panel, near infrared light therapy, red light therapy, cabinet sauna upgrade, photobiomodulation device, radiant heat therapy, FireLight Bulb, detoxification support, skin rejuvenation, circadian rhythm regulation","mentions_entities":"FireLight Bulb, sauna stool, sauna pedestal, infrared sauna conversion, full-spectrum light therapy, flicker-free light, travel-friendly light therapy, EMF shielding, home sauna setup, daily wellness routine"}},"richtext_content_y38mKK":{"type":"richtext-content","blocks":{"content_NbXaxJ":{"type":"content","settings":{"spacing_top":0,"spacing_bottom":60,"spacing_top_mobile":0,"spacing_bottom_mobile":30,"font_size":14,"font_size_mobile":12,"alt_bullets":false,"text_align":"left","content":"<p>The Hearth Infrared Sauna Panel is the simplest way to bring targeted light therapy into your daily life. Compact yet powerful, it delivers a concentrated spectrum of incandescent near-infrared and red light designed to <a href=\"\/blogs\/the-wavelength\/near-infrared-sauna-benefits\" title=\"The 12 Life-Changing Benefits of Near-Infrared Sauna: A Complete Guide to the FireLight Experience\">support detoxification, cellular repair, and relaxation<\/a>, without overwhelming your space. Whether you're easing into the practice or complementing another sauna setup, the Hearth offers a flexible, effective option grounded in biological coherence.<\/p><p>Each panel is handcrafted using clean, non-toxic materials and built with integrated EMF shielding to support safe, restorative use. There is no flicker, no harsh LEDs, and no synthetic interference. Just natural light and heat your body can recognize and respond to. Use it while seated, standing, or during targeted sessions for areas that need extra care. Many begin here and later expand their healing environment with additional panels or full-body enclosures.<\/p><p>If you're new to light therapy or curious about how near-infrared differs from red light or far-infrared saunas, we recommend starting with our <a href=\"\/blogs\/the-wavelength\/saunaspace-101\" title=\"SaunaSpace 101: Light, Heat, and the Future of Healing\">SaunaSpace 101 guide<\/a>. It explains the science, the benefits, and what makes this spectrum so uniquely aligned with the body's natural intelligence.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["content_NbXaxJ"],"name":"Summary","settings":{}},"recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"You May Also Like"}},"zp-product-footer-content":{"type":"product-footer-content-zipifypages","settings":{}}},"order":["zp-product-header-content","main","faq_LXTRKf","witb_with_dropdown_HbTpcy","faq_LqeTV3","faq_LXTRKff","image_and_text_v4_9C3zGh","image_and_features_v2_AYfAXV","images_feed_pNpFmd","okendo_reviews_header_6K6mXQ","1731491955acfc101c","product_faq_qKQPBF","richtext_content_y38mKK","recommendations","zp-product-footer-content"]}